 "text": "Hey, how are you feeling? Weddings push us to the limits. How's your partner holding up? That's tough. Lots of small snacks and a hot spot if she sits down for a bit. Like the bride running out of white dresses, the rain postponing the reception, and the father of the bride falling over in his waltz. Meanwhile, you've got all the small details, the guest list, the venue, the budget. She'd be terrible at it though, constantly second guessing herself.",
